SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus (disappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 19:34:58 +07\, seen from Ho Chi Minh City\,
  VN.\nThe Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is abov
 e the horizon.\nThe Moon is 6° up in the WSW · dark sky.\nTimes for the 
 Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: 
 https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=10.8230&lon=106.6296
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=10.8230&lon=106.6296
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
